Package: tlosint-carbon14
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Description: OSINT dating of web content
 Carbon14 estimates when the resources behind a web page were published, by
 reading the Last-Modified headers a server returns for a page's images and
 other assets and reconciling them against the page itself.
 .
 Ships a self-contained virtualenv under /opt/tracelabs/carbon14 so its
 dependency pins cannot collide with other OSINT tools on the system.
